  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with sweet soy seasoning and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652de9c399e28269ac3dd291-529c68fa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Thinly slice red radish and long chilli (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652de9c399e28269ac3dd291-55d47c67.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine deluxe salad mix, mixed salad leaves, cucumber, red radish, garlic aioli and Japanese style dressing. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652de9c399e28269ac3dd291-078189c0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide radish salad between bowls.\n• Top with Asian-style roast pumpkin, crunchy fried noodles and chilli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652de9c399e28269ac3dd291-b928d4ea.jpeg"
    }
  ]
